  "$comment": "EIP-712 schema of FillTicket — the dispatcher's assignment CancoreRouter.fill verifies — and its golden vectors. The contract is the source of truth: test/CancoreRouter.ts checks this file against TICKET_TYPEHASH, TICKET_DOMAIN_SEPARATOR and hashTicket. @cancore/contracts mirrors it (sdk: npm run sync) and checks the same vectors with its own encoder. The vectors are @cancore/contracts' canonical set (CAN-2139, sdk 4c6971f), byte for byte: the router computing each of them in test/CancoreRouter.ts is the cross-check between the two repositories.",
